window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>From number one, worldwide, best-selling fantasy author Morgan Rice comes the third book in a long-anticipated science-fiction series. With planet Earth destroyed, what will become of 13-year-old Kevin and Chloe in the mother ship?</b></p> <p>Will the aliens enslave them? What do they want? Is there any hope of escape? And will Kevin and Chloe ever return to Earth again?</p> <p>Book four in the series is also now available! Also available are Morgan Rice’s many series in the fantasy genre, including five-star reviewed <i>A Quest of Heroes</i>, book one in The Sorcerer's Ring!</p>"; 
